---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer__inner">
    <div>
      <a class="footer-brand" href="/">taha.log()</a>
      <p>ゲームを中心に、気になったことをログに残す。</p>
      <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="フッターリンク">
        <a href="/about/">About</a>
        <a href="/pr-policy/">PR / AD Policy</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-meta">
      <p>GAMES / AI / DEV / GADGETS / HOUSE</p>
      <p>&copy; {year} taha.log()</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 7rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .site-footer__inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 3rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 2.6rem 3.2rem;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .footer-meta {
    text-align: right;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .footer-meta p:first-child {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .site-footer {
      margin-top: 5rem;
    }

    .site-footer__inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      width: min(100% - 2rem, 1180px);
    }

    .footer-meta {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>